Remmi is not an application.

Remmi is an event-driven runtime that coordinates independent capabilities to assist the user.

Remmi is a platform for personal productivity.

Its goal is to orchestrate information and actions across the phone,
allowing plugins to expose capabilities and automations to combine them.

Plugins do not communicate directly with one another.

// NEW STRUCTURE
All communication goes through the Remmi Runtime.

